1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:02,134
OSCAR's built-in Flight Recorder runs automatically on every node; click Help (?) in the top bar to open the Operator Quick Guide & Diagnostics.

2
00:00:02,174 --> 00:00:05,056
Click Export Support Bundle to merge the 400-event browser Flight Recorder with rolling server logs into oscar-support-<UTC>.zip (or client-only if offline).

3
00:00:05,096 --> 00:00:10,585
When containers are stopped or unreachable, run sudo bash oscar.sh support-bundle or oscar.bat support-bundle on the host to capture oscar-host-support-<UTC>.zip.

4
00:00:10,625 --> 00:00:16,325
Inspect summary.json, client/client-diagnostics.json, and redaction-report.json to review flight-recorder events with automatic [REDACTED] credential scrubbing.
